Package: microsoft-ime-fcitx5
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Microsoft IME Fcitx5 Project <microsoft-ime-fcitx5@localhost>
Depends: fcitx5 (>= 5.0.14), ${shlibs:Depends}, winehq-stable (>= 11) | wine (>= 11), winehq-stable (>= 11) | wine64 (>= 11), systemd, dbus-user-session, init-system-helpers (>= 1.62), bubblewrap, xvfb, xauth, libx11-6, libxext6, libxrender1, libxrandr2, libxcomposite1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxinerama1, libfreetype6, libfontconfig1, msitools, curl, ca-certificates, util-linux, xdg-utils
Recommends: fcitx5-config-qt, fcitx5-frontend-gtk3, fonts-noto-cjk
Description: Fcitx5 adapter for the Microsoft Chinese Keyboard engine
 Runs the independently acquired Microsoft Pinyin engine in an isolated Wine
 prefix. Supplies a per-user service and a local web interface for Microsoft's
 engine settings and Fcitx5 display options.
